Subject: [PATCH] test(app): update the unmeasured bore count band

Center the fallback on the current solidcore mesh reading. Keep the existing band widths and exact platform pins. Exercise the fallback directly with portable boundary and old-mesh regression tests.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI GPT-6.1 Sol <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #3085
